Description: Advanced GNOME customization tool for Ubuntu and CachyOS
 TweaksPlus is a native GTK4/Rust alternative to GNOME Tweaks. It exposes the
 familiar appearance, fonts, keyboard, mouse, sound, windows and startup
 panels, plus classic top bar, desktop, workspaces, general and power tweaks.
 .
 All settings use GSettings, so changes apply immediately and stay in sync
 with the rest of the desktop.
